WEBVTT

00:40.240 --> 00:43.690
I can't get out because there's no door...

00:53.380 --> 00:56.370
Because there's no door...?

00:57.790 --> 00:59.389
Yuki...

00:59.390 --> 01:02.659
Yuki... Yuki... Yuki...

01:02.660 --> 01:04.320
Yuki!

01:08.100 --> 01:09.799
Yuki...

01:09.800 --> 01:11.269
No...

01:11.270 --> 01:13.839
Say something, Yuki...

01:13.840 --> 01:15.269
No...!

01:15.270 --> 01:16.399
Yuki!

01:16.400 --> 01:18.900
Because there's no door...?

01:20.640 --> 01:22.179
No.

01:22.180 --> 01:24.279
There is a door...

01:24.280 --> 01:26.010
That's...

01:27.780 --> 01:29.810
for Tama to select...

01:44.530 --> 01:47.500
"This Selection..."

01:58.650 --> 02:00.149
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

02:00.150 --> 02:04.189
<i>ideals are repetitious
games that slip through</i>

02:04.190 --> 02:06.889
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

02:06.890 --> 02:09.789
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

02:09.790 --> 02:11.059
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

02:11.060 --> 02:15.229
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

02:15.230 --> 02:20.299
<i>The final bell holding
together the crumbling day rings</i>

02:20.300 --> 02:24.709
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

02:24.710 --> 02:27.339
<i>you're there</i>

02:27.340 --> 02:30.149
<i>with a smile</i>

02:30.150 --> 02:35.649
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

02:35.650 --> 02:39.090
<i>And still</i>

02:40.720 --> 02:43.929
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

02:43.930 --> 02:48.199
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

02:48.200 --> 02:50.599
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

02:50.600 --> 02:52.269
<i>Now cross</i>

02:52.270 --> 02:54.939
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

02:54.940 --> 03:02.039
<i>The future of light and dark,
let's believe in the "future"</i>

03:02.040 --> 03:08.540
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

03:09.950 --> 03:12.349
"No Trespassing"

03:12.350 --> 03:16.619
We'll be in big trouble if
the person earlier finds out...

03:16.620 --> 03:19.250
But, we need to check the place out.

03:24.900 --> 03:26.530
Yuki...

03:27.540 --> 03:29.539
Yuki...!

03:29.540 --> 03:30.769
Yuki!

03:30.770 --> 03:33.209
So... pretty...

03:33.210 --> 03:38.410
Ru, your tears... shine like gems...

03:40.220 --> 03:43.719
I wanted to be your LRIG.

03:43.720 --> 03:46.719
LRIG to the greatest of Selectors...

03:46.720 --> 03:52.559
But... my true desire
was probably different.

03:52.560 --> 03:59.929
Mayu's sorrow... dark... filth... pain...

03:59.930 --> 04:04.070
I was born from those feelings...

04:05.640 --> 04:10.170
But... battling alongside you...

04:11.610 --> 04:18.749
You, Ru... came inside me...

04:18.750 --> 04:20.750
and spread within me...

04:24.360 --> 04:32.360
I felt... something very
beautiful, and precious filling me...

04:34.340 --> 04:38.109
You showed me...

04:38.110 --> 04:40.039
what I truly desired.

04:40.040 --> 04:41.279
Yuki...

04:41.280 --> 04:43.179
Thank you...

04:43.180 --> 04:45.179
Ru.

04:45.180 --> 04:48.149
Stop it! I don't want to hear your thanks!

04:48.150 --> 04:51.149
I don't like the way you're
making it sound like a farewell!

04:51.150 --> 04:54.019
Why is she crying?

04:54.020 --> 04:57.029
Why would parting be painful for her?

04:57.030 --> 04:59.820
After all, for me it wasn't...

05:01.030 --> 05:05.329
I don't give a damn about your
emotional farewells and tears.

05:05.330 --> 05:07.999
The battle ends when an LRIG disappears.

05:08.000 --> 05:10.970
You girls lose by default.

05:12.010 --> 05:14.679
Say, Iona, or should I say, Yuki-<i>san...</i>

05:14.680 --> 05:17.670
are you still able to battle?

05:19.380 --> 05:22.350
Ru and Yuki won't lose.

05:30.530 --> 05:32.080
Shiro!
Tama!

05:34.730 --> 05:36.699
This can't be...

05:36.700 --> 05:39.199
How did she get out?

05:39.200 --> 05:41.399
Tama...

05:41.400 --> 05:43.399
Ru...

05:43.400 --> 05:44.539
Use Grow...

05:44.540 --> 05:45.510
Huh?

05:45.511 --> 05:49.109
Make Tama and Yuki into one.

05:49.110 --> 05:51.349
R-Ru...

05:51.350 --> 05:53.249
You don't need to do that.

05:53.250 --> 05:57.589
Me coming together as one
with Tama will just taint her.

05:57.590 --> 05:59.689
Yuki, you're pretty.

05:59.690 --> 06:03.259
Just like the snow that
shines under the sun.

06:03.260 --> 06:06.189
Pretty... Me...?

06:06.190 --> 06:09.129
Tama, who dreams of the summer sun...

06:09.130 --> 06:12.399
and Yuki, who loves the winter snow.

06:12.400 --> 06:15.130
If Tama and Yuki come together as one...

06:17.210 --> 06:20.970
you'll be like the
snow, falling in summer.

06:26.810 --> 06:28.280
Grow.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.319
Level 5...

06:32.320 --> 06:33.750
Mayu!

06:35.660 --> 06:39.920
Wh-Why my name...?

06:46.500 --> 06:49.939
I really like Tama...

06:49.940 --> 06:51.939
I really like Yuki...

06:51.940 --> 06:56.279
And the person who created
them both is you, Mayu.

06:56.280 --> 07:01.079
Honestly, I can't say
that I like you right now.

07:01.080 --> 07:04.119
After all, everyone went
through a lot of suffering.

07:04.120 --> 07:07.989
And even now, everyone is in pain.

07:07.990 --> 07:13.629
Some girls have lasting scars on
their bodies and in their minds, too.

07:13.630 --> 07:16.359
But, you had a chance to become Mayu...

07:16.360 --> 07:17.669
What?

07:17.670 --> 07:20.769
The true you is next to me.

07:20.770 --> 07:24.669
I'm sure if this wasn't how things were...

07:24.670 --> 07:26.609
If we didn't meet like this...

07:26.610 --> 07:30.700
I would have really liked you, too.

07:32.350 --> 07:35.519
Th-That...

07:35.520 --> 07:40.119
Hearing that doesn't make
me the least bit happy!

07:40.120 --> 07:43.789
I hate... I hate how you used past tense!

07:43.790 --> 07:46.990
Urith! Black Desire!

07:48.060 --> 07:50.900
Now you're talking, Mayu!

07:57.210 --> 07:58.239
Mayu!

07:58.240 --> 08:00.639
Ru, let's battle!

08:00.640 --> 08:04.810
Even if Selector battles
themselves are wrong...

08:05.980 --> 08:11.080
it still is the one and only
wish coming from Mayu!

08:13.220 --> 08:14.420
Okay.

08:40.050 --> 08:43.020
What a sad looking room...

08:45.050 --> 08:47.889
Mayu! Summon Arc Energe!

08:47.890 --> 08:49.119
Okay!

08:49.120 --> 08:51.350
Attack with Laevateinn!

09:02.870 --> 09:04.439
Mayu, are you okay?

09:04.440 --> 09:05.869
Yes.

09:05.870 --> 09:07.310
Why...?

09:10.080 --> 09:13.810
Why are you calling her by that name?

09:14.880 --> 09:16.319
How is that doing?

09:16.320 --> 09:19.289
Well, aside from her lack of appetite...

09:19.290 --> 09:21.159
So, is that girl back?

09:21.160 --> 09:23.959
Not that it matters to me...
So did that eat dinner already?

09:23.960 --> 09:25.829
What is that doing?

09:25.830 --> 09:27.259
Make that take a bath.

09:27.260 --> 09:29.420
Not that I care...

09:30.570 --> 09:35.730
My name was never spoken
in such a caring tone before...

09:40.410 --> 09:42.639
Look at yourself!

09:42.640 --> 09:46.849
Aren't you supposed to be
the greatest Selector there is?!

09:46.850 --> 09:48.840
Selector...

09:50.320 --> 09:52.510
One who selects...

09:53.690 --> 09:57.789
I... didn't select anything...

09:57.790 --> 09:59.929
Mayu...?

09:59.930 --> 10:03.299
It's not that I didn't
want to make a selection.

10:03.300 --> 10:06.130
I didn't have any selections to make...!

10:07.340 --> 10:10.339
That's right... I...

10:10.340 --> 10:15.679
I didn't take everything
away from everyone...

10:15.680 --> 10:19.509
I gave everyone an
opportunity to make a selection.

10:19.510 --> 10:22.949
Even if they were
crying, smiling, or angry...

10:22.950 --> 10:25.389
at least they could select!

10:25.390 --> 10:29.859
I was even denied that!

10:29.860 --> 10:35.629
The only thing that connects to the
outside is the sky seen from that window.

10:35.630 --> 10:39.999
This room was Mayu's world...

10:40.000 --> 10:42.339
I didn't have a chance to select...

10:42.340 --> 10:45.069
That's not true.

10:45.070 --> 10:48.579
Why did you seal Tama away, Mayu?

10:48.580 --> 10:51.509
Why did you only allow
Yuki to participate in battle?

10:51.510 --> 10:52.909
That's...

10:52.910 --> 10:56.819
Mayu hated the world outside the window...

10:56.820 --> 10:59.919
the world lit by light.

10:59.920 --> 11:06.029
But in reality, she sought and longed for
the world outside more than anyone else.

11:06.030 --> 11:09.559
That's why, just when
Mayu's life came to an end...

11:09.560 --> 11:13.169
she made a selection...

11:13.170 --> 11:16.500
With that, Tama awakened...

11:18.670 --> 11:22.209
Beyond the colors of black, and of white...

11:22.210 --> 11:24.779
was a world of many colors...

11:24.780 --> 11:30.249
where Tama, longing for light
that Mayu held, was released to.

11:30.250 --> 11:33.190
No... No! No!

11:37.260 --> 11:39.359
No... No...

11:39.360 --> 11:42.420
That's not me... I wouldn't...

11:43.600 --> 11:48.099
Come see the world outside
together with everyone.

11:48.100 --> 11:49.799
How can you say such a thing?!

11:49.800 --> 11:50.900
Huh?

11:53.540 --> 11:54.709
Mayu is...

11:54.710 --> 11:56.610
already dead!

12:17.300 --> 12:20.269
What? What's going on?!

12:20.270 --> 12:21.270
Mayu!

12:28.480 --> 12:30.109
Ruko...

12:30.110 --> 12:31.609
Mayu!

12:31.610 --> 12:36.619
Why... are you trying to
protect the LRIG I created?

12:36.620 --> 12:40.959
No one... loved me...

12:40.960 --> 12:43.450
No one called me by my name...

12:48.430 --> 12:50.990
No one embraced me...

12:54.000 --> 12:55.300
No one...

12:58.640 --> 13:01.179
If we didn't meet like this...

13:01.180 --> 13:05.370
I would have really liked you, too.

13:07.620 --> 13:10.549
If we met...

13:10.550 --> 13:12.020
could things have changed?

13:26.870 --> 13:29.069
I●●●

13:29.070 --> 13:34.739
was to become an unknown
existence and perish here.

13:34.740 --> 13:36.839
I wanted others to know...

13:36.840 --> 13:42.879
I wanted to affect the lives of
others with the life I lived here.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.819
Even if...

13:44.820 --> 13:47.149
that was hatred.

13:47.150 --> 13:48.219
I●●●

13:48.220 --> 13:52.159
I want to get to know more about you, Mayu!

13:52.160 --> 13:55.390
And not through hatred,
or with bad feelings!

13:57.430 --> 14:00.330
Guess what color I selected.

14:01.900 --> 14:04.769
The color Mayu selected?

14:04.770 --> 14:06.769
Urith at Level 5...

14:06.770 --> 14:10.779
can control all colors.

14:10.780 --> 14:14.579
This move can be used only once.

14:14.580 --> 14:17.279
If you can guess what Mayu selected...

14:17.280 --> 14:19.289
you win, Ru.

14:19.290 --> 14:21.780
Get it wrong, and Mayu wins.

14:23.190 --> 14:26.750
This card... is Mayu's heart.

14:28.060 --> 14:30.199
The color Mayu selected...

14:30.200 --> 14:34.299
Is it the color of dark, the hatred
she had for the outside world?

14:34.300 --> 14:38.070
Or, is it the color of light
that sealed Tama away?

14:45.150 --> 14:47.309
Beyond the colors of black...

14:47.310 --> 14:49.449
and of white...

14:49.450 --> 14:52.250
was a world of many colors...

14:53.490 --> 14:55.460
That's right...

15:02.730 --> 15:04.599
Hurry it up already!

15:04.600 --> 15:07.329
I can't hold myself back any longer!

15:07.330 --> 15:08.799
Now, Ru...

15:08.800 --> 15:11.000
what color is this card?

15:14.910 --> 15:16.900
A world without colors.

15:20.480 --> 15:23.079
That card...

15:23.080 --> 15:24.680
is non-colored.

15:27.990 --> 15:29.150
What?

15:34.800 --> 15:36.959
W-Wait a second!

15:36.960 --> 15:38.129
This can't be!

15:38.130 --> 15:42.169
Me, executed without a fight?!

15:42.170 --> 15:45.140
Noooo...!

15:53.880 --> 15:57.119
I have nothing in my
hand, and no Arts to use.

15:57.120 --> 16:01.659
Mayu can't do anything in the next turn.

16:01.660 --> 16:03.389
Non-colored.

16:03.390 --> 16:08.330
A color that erases all and
marks the end of all things.

16:12.500 --> 16:16.739
And, it's a color that marks
the beginning of everything, too.

16:16.740 --> 16:20.230
It can be colored any way you want.

16:21.980 --> 16:25.310
Mayu, you're going to set the colors.

16:27.480 --> 16:29.479
Mayu...

16:29.480 --> 16:31.419
can begin again?

16:31.420 --> 16:32.890
Yup.

16:34.520 --> 16:36.150
Mayu...

16:38.660 --> 16:41.560
can be embraced by someone?

16:47.500 --> 16:48.830
Yup.

17:17.870 --> 17:18.899
Mayu...

17:18.900 --> 17:20.300
Ruko...

17:21.300 --> 17:25.409
Let's take our oath before
this world disappears.

17:25.410 --> 17:28.939
This time, let's make
your wish come true, Ru.

17:28.940 --> 17:31.479
My wish...?

17:31.480 --> 17:37.320
It was to return the girls who became LRIG
cards back to their original selves, right?

17:40.420 --> 17:43.759
Turn the girls who
became LRIGs into humans.

17:43.760 --> 17:45.259
What?

17:45.260 --> 17:49.129
That would make you return back
to your original form, Mayu, but...

17:49.130 --> 17:54.120
it may turn Tama and
Yuki into humans, too.

17:56.440 --> 17:58.639
Ru, you're like a kid.

17:58.640 --> 17:59.809
Huh?

17:59.810 --> 18:02.309
Ru... you do understand, right?

18:02.310 --> 18:06.410
Making a selection means to
select one thing, not everything.

18:07.850 --> 18:10.149
I did make a selection.

18:10.150 --> 18:15.759
I'm not going to make a selection
at the sacrifice of something else.

18:15.760 --> 18:23.760
Even if that brings hardships, sorrow, or times
where I may cry, I'll still select everything.

18:28.170 --> 18:30.970
That's the selection I made!

18:36.640 --> 18:39.610
You really are a kid...

18:42.180 --> 18:44.780
Look who's talking, Mayu.

18:47.990 --> 18:49.789
I accept...

18:49.790 --> 18:52.230
the laws of the Selector.

18:58.300 --> 18:59.669
Now...

18:59.670 --> 19:03.000
a new Eternal Girl will be born!

19:17.250 --> 19:20.319
Looks like that building's finished.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.719
Guess things didn't disappear
even after the pillar fit in.

19:22.720 --> 19:27.859
Oh my, why are you so dressed up?
You have plans with the others?

19:27.860 --> 19:30.329
Yup! We're studying for our school exam.

19:30.330 --> 19:31.429
What about dinner?

19:31.430 --> 19:34.399
Ah, I won't be out too late today, so...

19:34.400 --> 19:37.339
Ou... ch...
Wha...?! Yikes!

19:37.340 --> 19:40.769
Gotta hand it to piggy-Ru. That hit hard...

19:40.770 --> 19:44.609
Well, if you're going to sleep,
sleep in bed or something.

19:44.610 --> 19:46.279
Be careful now.

19:46.280 --> 19:48.949
Okay! I'm off!

19:48.950 --> 19:50.940
Have fun.

19:52.450 --> 19:56.959
Looks like Ru-<i>chan</i> grew, didn't she?

19:56.960 --> 19:59.559
Really?

19:59.560 --> 20:01.129
Why yes.

20:01.130 --> 20:03.460
She's grown so much.

20:07.200 --> 20:09.869
That's it! My brain
can't take this anymore!

20:09.870 --> 20:12.569
It's only been an hour, you know?

20:12.570 --> 20:13.809
She's right.

20:13.810 --> 20:18.079
If you're planning to go to the same school
as Hitoe, you'll have to do your best.

20:18.080 --> 20:19.279
Hitoe...

20:19.280 --> 20:21.249
gimme some of your brains!

20:21.250 --> 20:22.379
Come on...

20:22.380 --> 20:26.049
Say, how about we take a break?

20:26.050 --> 20:28.250
A break...?

20:29.290 --> 20:31.280
Let's play WIXOSS!

20:34.960 --> 20:37.230
Trash Rhino with Tawil!

20:38.170 --> 20:42.569
The Activation Ability on
Yuzuki's new LRIG is super!

20:42.570 --> 20:46.939
Kazuki recommended
that I try different cards.

20:46.940 --> 20:52.400
But, none of the LRIG cards match
me as well as Hanayo-<i>san</i> did...

21:00.150 --> 21:04.020
The world of Selector battles has ended.

21:10.830 --> 21:15.439
The girls who were sealed
into cards as LRIGs...

21:15.440 --> 21:17.685
were able to return
to their former selves.

21:17.686 --> 21:20.000
"Summer's Renewal Edition"

21:20.840 --> 21:23.109
Selector battles...

21:23.110 --> 21:27.310
What was the game all about?

21:24.380 --> 21:25.480
- "Featuring This Summer's Trends"
- "Aoi Akira's Trends" "Gotta be WIXOSS"

21:25.481 --> 21:27.281
"Akira's Resolute
Declaration to Blue Decks!"

21:38.330 --> 21:44.390
A game that was born from the
hatred and sorrow of a single girl.

21:48.140 --> 21:56.079
A game of broken rules where only
sorrow lay in wait no matter the selection.

21:56.080 --> 21:58.209
But...

21:58.210 --> 22:01.849
we found something within that game.

22:01.850 --> 22:03.320
- "Excuse me"
- "We can become friends-y."

22:09.020 --> 22:14.330
We found alternatives outside the
rules from which to make a selection.

22:16.500 --> 22:20.669
If we didn't participate in the
game, we never would have known...

22:20.670 --> 22:23.570
or found what was precious to us.

22:27.570 --> 22:31.009
And, I made my selection.

22:31.010 --> 22:32.600
So...

22:40.350 --> 22:43.019
I'll continue...

22:43.020 --> 22:44.960
my search...

22:50.630 --> 22:52.190
Ru...

22:53.400 --> 22:54.560
Ru!

23:07.110 --> 23:11.050
for a yet unseen, new selection.

23:14.720 --> 23:17.450
Believing that...

23:19.790 --> 23:21.799
is my...

23:21.800 --> 23:24.290
Ru's selection.
